\item in other languages:\\

\end{enumerate}
\item[* relevant literature/documents:]
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
If rules are written to generate imperatives with lexical subjects such as {\em 
everybody, you}, these rules need to be evaluated again on their proper 
functioning. 
